---
import NoticeLayout from "@/layouts/NoticeLayout.astro";
import { site } from "@/site.config";
---

<NoticeLayout title="Website policy" description="Editorial principles, attribution, AI assistance and responsible use of this website.">
  <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
  <p>
    This website shares selected professional activities and research outputs.
    Summaries provide context and do not replace published papers, underlying
    methods, data documentation or formal institutional statements. Publication
    and presentation dates refer to the work itself; website summaries may be
    revised as information changes.
  </p>

  <h2>AI assistance</h2>
  <p>
    AI tools have supported drafting, editing, design and coding for this website.
    {site.name} is responsible for reviewing website content and deciding what to
    publish. AI assistance does not establish the accuracy of a statement or
    imply AI involvement in the underlying research. Refer to each publication
    for its own authorship, methods and disclosures.
  </p>

  <h2>Attribution and reuse</h2>
  <p>
    When discussing research featured here, cite the original publication or
    resource and credit its authors. Check the relevant licence before copying
    text, images, slides, code or data. The <a href="/legal/">legal notice</a>
    explains how existing rights and licences apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Responsible use</h2>
  <p>
    Please use the site in a way that respects other people's privacy and
    intellectual property and does not disrupt its availability or security.
    Do not send identifiable patient information, confidential datasets or other
    sensitive material through the contact email without first agreeing on an
    appropriate secure method of communication.
  </p>

  <h2>Feedback and updates</h2>
  <p>
    Suggestions and corrections can be sent to
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    These policies may be updated to reflect changes to the website; the date
    above identifies the latest revision of this page.
  </p>
</NoticeLayout>
